            "QUAL"
          ],
          "evidence_anchors": [
            "SRC-021"
          ],
          "suggestions": []
        },
        {
          "statement": "The statistical analysis is rigorous, utilizing high-probability bounds derived via concentration inequalities and Rademacher complexity, with the use of small-ball methods for unbounded losses being appropriate and well-motivated.",
